      "line": 25,
      "start": 36,
      "end": 64,
      "source_quote": "子邵，員外散騎侍郎，妻燾女也，生僧祐，有吏才，再為山陰令",
      "interpretation": "傳明僧祐父邵、母為燾女，兩任山陰令。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "source-evidence/song092-xunli/external/ws1996687.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1996687,
      "raw_sha256": "ccea9f27fb0ca02b7cbe963e18e57064d140580faf5d91142bfdd84d8f852e5b",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1996687",
      "line": 25,
      "start": 77,
      "end": 89,
      "source_quote": "亦以徐湛之黨，為元凶所殺",
      "interpretation": "傅僧祐死於元凶之亂。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/songshu006-ws2310150.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 2310150,
      "raw_sha256": "587d282621c8fb306c1c037f4cca64c3624aaa3c86ec77f7831368cbdfcb683a",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2310150",
      "line": 148,
      "start": 12,
      "end": 28,
      "source_quote": "壬戌，以寧朔將軍劉道隆為徐州刺史",
      "interpretation": "孝武紀大明二年九月任徐州。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/songshu006-ws2310150.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 2310150,
      "raw_sha256": "587d282621c8fb306c1c037f4cca64c3624aaa3c86ec77f7831368cbdfcb683a",
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2310150",
      "line": 223,
      "start": 33,
      "end": 51,
      "source_quote": "尚書右僕射劉秀之為安北將軍、雍州刺史",
      "interpretation": "劉秀之的將軍府有本紀任官可證。"
    },
    {
